sequenceDiagram
    actor Courier
    participant Orders as Order service
    participant Users as User Service
    participant Rating as Rating Service
    participant DB as Postgres

    Courier->>Orders: POST /api/v1/orders/{orderId}/accept
    Orders->>Rating: GET /api/v1/rating/{userId}
    Rating-->>Orders: average (or null)
    Orders->>Users: GET /internal/users/{userId}/telegram
    Users-->>Orders: telegram handle
    Orders->>DB: update only if status is still CREATED
    Note over DB: sets courier, rating, and collection deadline to now plus 5 minutes
    alt row updated
        Orders->>DB: order_log, alert, status outbox
        Orders-->>Courier: 200 ACCEPTED
    else order missing
        Orders-->>Courier: 404 Order not found
    else already claimed
        Orders-->>Courier: 409 This task was already claimed
    end
